_UHHdD0IqMQ3IcHCFwoCA",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_30_TO_60_MIN"],"30 到 60 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQ3YcHCF8oAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQ3IcHCF4oCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQ3YcHCGEoAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQ3IcHCGAoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["20260527\n連續兩天都來看〔老梅綠石槽〕，風景如畫，碧海藍天，看著浪花一層又一層捲土重來。冰涼的海水，彷彿把俗世的困惱也一起帶走。\n\n雖然騎車有點累，但吹著風真的讓人心曠神怡。心靈滿足了，當然要來漁人碼頭，填補一下空虛的胃。這次除了標榜海景的漁村餐廳。裡面是日式 丼飯 ,  拉麵，重點是套餐+100，可以任點一杯飲料，不用加價。\n\n點了豬排飯，牛丼飯 ,  不錯吃，但坐在位上等餐需要半小時。服務員會讓人先入座，點餐就要需要時間製作。",null,[0,68]]]],[],[null,null,2112,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWS04zcEpja2d0WjNGUUxUSjNkMGxNTFRWNGRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x149ceb29e1931d73!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlVKN3pJckgtZ3FQLTJ3d0lMLTV4dUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWS04zcEpja2d0WjNGUUxUSjNkMGxNTFRWNGRVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWS04zcEpja2d0WjNGUUxUSjNkMGxNTFRWNGRVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWS04zcEpja2d0WjNGUUxUSjNkMGxNTFRWNGRVRRILMGUzZWM5bzZvWWcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVktOM3BKY2tndFozRlFMVEozZDBsTUxUVjRkVUUSCzBlM2VjOW82b1lnIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARcx2T4SnrnBQqCzBlM2VjOW82b1ln\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQoykIYigL"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjthK3B8NSWAxWi9hYFHbweDRcQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjN5qbB8NSWAxWFb_UHHdD0IqMQ0pMFCEwoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paeFlVUXhlVEV6Y1dKUlZsRldUV3MwWlVOSFdHYxAB",["0x0:0x149ceb29e1931d73",null,1778421487615633,1778421487615633,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/1119